            <ArticleTitle>Derivatives of tramadol for increased duration of effect.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>691-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Tramadol is a centrally acting opioid analgesic structurally related to codeine and morphine. Analogs of tramadol with deuterium-for-hydrogen replacement at metabolically active sites were prepared and evaluated in vitro and in vivo.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
